						<td class="headline" align="left"><a name="#623">The History of the Kerrans</a></td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							The Kerran's is the ancestors of Vah Shirs, who lives in Odus of Norrath.   For hundred of years, the Kerran's ruled the <br />
island of Odus, even all races of Norrath knew the might of Kerra.   The great civilization began with a dream, a single <br />
Kerran believed that his people will rise and will be know throughtout the world, his name was Kejaan.  His legend <br />
grew as he traveled throughout the island of Odus, visisting the tribes of Kerran.   Kejaan with his strength of claw <br />
and mind united the tribes of Kerran into a great civilization.    <br />
<br />
For many years, the Kerran ruled thier island with strength and pride, but their empire enentually fell.  They honor and <br />
pride was torn apart by the Erudians.  The race of the Erudians came to the island and declared war against the <br />
Kerran.   The Kerrans tried to make peace and tried to share the land with the Erudians, but the Erudians destroyed <br />
everything in their path.  The evil race removed all traces of  achievements, cities, stautes, and writings of the <br />
Kerrans.  Eventually, the population of the Kerrans was decreasing and they had to run to islands for safehaven.  Only <br />
a few of the population lives today.
						</td>
