					<tr>
						<td class="headline" align="left"><a name="#622">KERRAN UNITY CHARTER:  Mission and Rlues</a></td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							To gather together kindred souls, of the Vah Shir race, who wish to protect the lands of our people and of our ancestors. This will be accomplished by assisting new players, developing the power of the guild and its resources, and direct conflict with the evil Erudites and poachers located throughout the Realms. Above all we will maintain the highest levels of honesty, integrity, and chivalry. <br />
<br />
To Join<br />
<br />
1. You must be a Vah Shir and 15th season to join. <br />
<br />
2. The officers will establish a quest for you to see if you are loyal and can holdup the KU laws to the guild. <br />
<br />
3. Fill out the application after adventuring with a current member of Ispu rank or above. <br />
<br />
4. Uphold the KU Charter and Laws.   <br />
<br />
5.-If a Vah Shir wants to delate his character, then he has to wait until he is 15th level again to rejoin with guild.  NOTE:  We are strickly playing a roleplaying setting, NO EXCEPTIONS!  The guild can help power level them back to 15th level again<br />
<br />
*The name of the ranking and more laws in Kerran Unity go to www.kerranunity.com for more information!<br />
<br />
*If you are intersted in joining in this guild, please write to the messange board and I will contact you as soon as possible.
						</td>
